flowchart TD
    Start([User Submits Prompt]) --> AuthValidate{Verify JWT Token}
    AuthValidate -- Invalid --> ReturnAuthError[Emit 401 Unauthorized Response]
    AuthValidate -- Valid --> IntentFilter{Classify Query Intent}

    IntentFilter -- Student Personal Data --> CheckStudentProfile[Locate StudentProfile by JWT enrollment_no]
    CheckStudentProfile --> ExecRiskCalc[Calculate Deficit & Consecutive Recovery Classes N]
    ExecRiskCalc --> BuildPersonalResponse[Generate Structured Academic Payload]

    IntentFilter -- Institutional Policy --> GenAudience[Derive Audience Scope: student, faculty, admin]
    GenAudience --> VectorSearch[ChromaDB Nearest Neighbor Cosine Search]
    VectorSearch --> CheckStudentDirDoc{Contains Private Student Records?}
    CheckStudentDirDoc -- Yes --> StripDoc[Security Guardrail: Evict Document from Context]
    CheckStudentDirDoc -- No --> LexicalScoring[Calculate Term Match Frequency & Density]
    StripDoc --> LexicalScoring
    
    LexicalScoring --> ComputeComposite[Compute Composite Rerank Score = 0.6*V + 0.4*L + Bonus]
    ComputeComposite --> AssessEvidence{Max Score >= 0.25 Threshold?}
    
    AssessEvidence -- No --> TriggerRefusal[Return Zero-Hallucination Fallback String]
    AssessEvidence -- Yes --> DetermineBand[Assign Quality Band: HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW]
    DetermineBand --> FrameContext[Wrap Snippets inside untrusted_data XML Tag]
    FrameContext --> LLMCall[Invoke Gemini Flash Lite with Temperature=0.2]
    LLMCall --> CompileCitations[Format Document Metadata, Chunk Index & Snippet]

    BuildPersonalResponse --> LogAudit[Log Action to AuditRepository]
    TriggerRefusal --> LogAudit
    CompileCitations --> LogAudit

    LogAudit --> Finish([Send Response to Client])
